  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MCF Projekt f&#xf6;r Ukrainas resiliens: r&#xe4;ddningstj&#xe4;nst och minhantering 2024-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MCF Strengthening Ukraine&#x2019;s resilience: Mine Action and Rescue Service (MARS) - MSB Strengthening Ukraine&#x2019;s resilience: Mine Action and Rescue Service (MARS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Myndigheten f&#xf6;r civilt f&#xf6;rsvar (MCF) kommer genom denna insats st&#xf6;dja &#xf6;kad ukrainsk motst&#xe5;ndskraft och f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att effektivt minska och hantera konsekvenserna av olyckor, n&#xf6;dsituationer och annan p&#xe5;verkan till f&#xf6;ljd av kriget.

Programmet implementeras under 2024 - 2027 och inneh&#xe5;ller 2 komponenter: 1) R&#xe4;ddningstj&#xe4;nst och civilskydd och 2) Minhantering. I b&#xe5;da komponenterna kommer MCF att ge st&#xf6;d till relevanta ukrainska myndigheter, inklusive med utrustning och utbildning. Komponent 1 &#xe4;r ocks&#xe5; relevant f&#xf6;r Ukrainas EU-anslutningsprocess.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Civil Defence and Resilience Agency (MCF, after the Swedish abbreviation) will through this programme support increased Ukrainian resilience and capability to effectively reduce and manage consequences of accidents, emergencies and war.

The programme is implemented during 2024 - 2027 and it includes 2 components: 1)  Rescue Services and Civil Protection and 2) Mine action. In both components MCF will provide support to relevant Ukrainian government agencies including with equipment and training. Component 1 is also relevant for Ukraine&apos;s EU Accession process.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed projects overall objective is to contribute to increased Ukrainian resilience and capability to effectively reduce and manage consequences of accidents, emergencies and war.

Component 1 objective: Increased capability within State Emergency Service of Ukraine (SESU) to effectively respond to severe incidents and emergencies.

Component 2 objective: Increased and sustainable capacity of state actors to reduce the threat of explosive remnants of war on life, environment, livelihoods and vital infrastructure in Ukraine.</narrative>
  </description>
